// menu_lint (tools\menu_lint.py) holds the tuning pages to the live-slider
// rule: every slider on them has to move the bands while the menu is open,
// which here means RSS_Handler.Push, run from UiTick -- see the LINT-UI-LIVE
// lines there and at PushAfterLook.
