//
// NOT LOOK SLIDERS, and exempt for that. These rows are read at the moment
// something happens, and the playsim is stopped while the menu is up, so
// nothing happens to show them.
//
// Sources > Fired: which kills count, and the reach, life and speed a band is
// GIVEN when it fires (RSS_Handler.Fire). A band already out keeps what it was
